OL,3,AStadium owner Robert Kraft says Ed
OL,4,ASheeran asked him to donate $2m in aid
OL,5,Aafter Macklemore backlash
OL,6,
OL,7,FRobert Kraft, the US stadium owner who
OL,8,Fhad pro-Palestinian rapper Macklemore
OL,9,Fremoved as Ed Sheeran's opening act,
OL,10,Fsays Sheeran asked him to match his own
OL,11,F$2m (#1.5m) donation for "aid in the
OL,12,Fregion".
OL,14,FIt came after Macklemore said he would
OL,15,Fdonate $1m (#750,000) to Palestinian
OL,16,Forganisations, challenging Kraft to
OL,17,Fmatch him.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789647589
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AStadium owner Robert Kraft says Ed
OL,4,ASheeran asked him to donate $2m in aid
OL,5,Aafter Macklemore backlash
OL,6,
OL,7,FKraft, who owns the New England
OL,8,FPatriots, wrote on Wednesday: "Earlier
OL,9,Ftoday, before Macklemore challenged me
OL,10,Fto match his donation, Ed called me and
OL,11,Fasked me to commit $2 million to match
OL,12,Fhis donation to aid in the region to
OL,13,Ffight this humanitarian crisis.
OL,15,F"Ed now plans to reach out to other
OL,16,Fvenue owners and our goal is to
OL,17,Fcontinue to work together to build
OL,18,Fbridges."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
